Note on derivative Papyrus content:

The files under `papyrus/PBFTerrainDetectionQuestScript.psc` and
`papyrus/PlayerBarefootQuestScript.psc` are derivatives of the original
"Barefoot Realism" mod by its respective author. Only the function bodies
hot-pathed through this plugin's natives have been changed; the rest of the
script, the form bindings, and the gameplay logic remain the original
author's work. Users redistributing those files should consult the upstream
Barefoot Realism license/permissions before doing so.
